# =============================================================================
# InterviewAI monorepo
#   backend/         Django + DRF, Celery
#   ai_services/     FastAPI, local models (Ollama, faster-whisper, Piper)
#   mobile/          React Native + Expo (TypeScript)
#   infrastructure/  Docker, Nginx, LiveKit, Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, Tempo
# =============================================================================

